        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: United Methodist Church\n- People: John Wesley, Charles Wesley, George Whitefield\n- Concepts: Methodism, revival movement, Great Awakening\n- Places: England, United States\n\nFacts:\n- John Wesley was an English Anglican cleric and theologian who lived from 28 June 1703 to 2 March 1791.\n- John Wesley, Charles Wesley, and George Whitefield founded Methodism.\n- The United Methodist Church traces its roots to the revival movement led by John and Charles Wesley in England.\n- The United Methodist Church also traces its roots to the Great Awakening in the United States.",
